     "description": "Known as \"Big Z\" and standing at 6\u20199\u201d, Zdeno Chara was renowned for his disruptive defense and physical presence rather than for dazzling offensive plays. However, in a game against Florida during the 2012-13 season, Chara executed a beautiful spin-a-rama after receiving a pass, depositing a backhander into the top of the net. Chara spent 14 of his 24-year career in Boston, where he won a Norris Trophy in 2009 and captained the team to a Stanley Cup championship in 2011.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
